{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"544d53bcbeaad77dd0effbd0501799fb8e2d9593a99415d4d119b0a9f96f489c","ja":"全力プロデュース！","zh":"全力制作！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6542340dbe8953c7d33cef32d7dd2c7aab259f7e0a0f238931a2c03a24acbba7","ja":"最初は歌のレッスンよ。少し難しい歌だけど、\n大事なポイントがたくさんあるから頑張りましょうね。","zh":"首先是唱歌的课程哦。虽然歌有点难，\n但重要的地方有很多，一起加油吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8678cd0ee7000535ad2631d7246e19d6c956535bc612ff3de30c226f0510790c","ja":"まずはそうね……麗花ちゃん、\nお手本として、ちょっと歌ってくれるかしら？","zh":"那就先这样吧……丽花，\n能做个示范，稍微唱一段吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d3ff04b6568f73c72b1362cccf86da70f685f9118c37dc3628c547f49121e28b","ja":"はーい♪　1番、北上麗花、歌いま～す！\nララ～♪　ララララ～♪","zh":"好～♪　1号，北上丽花，开始唱啦～\n啦啦～♪　啦啦啦啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ebefd2e9d225a155a77a38fbe9637d2adf6c3c4c11a15cb275599897c37fbbfe","ja":"「わあ……北上さんの歌、とっても綺麗……！\nそれに、聞いてると胸にぐっと響くというか……」","zh":"而且，听着听着就深深触动心底，该怎么说呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"4d2bf4906481270661bf7c5f67fd53b009ac7f3523093ccd728ff346ce99319e","ja":"そうね。歌詞や曲に込められた思いを\nどう解釈して歌うかが大切なのよ。","zh":"是啊。如何诠释歌词与曲中寄托的心意，\n再怎样把它唱出来，这才是关键哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"1301138fc58b06deff02ef684f6ec14d93c801f781b127933081363c5d85ab7b","ja":"それじゃあ、サツキちゃんも歌ってみて。","zh":"那么，サツキ也试着唱唱看吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"dd2a28c9edc45e296f9a23018b6c623f7391de1f78db5d7a73afb55f1ad37d23","ja":"レッスンは順調に進んで……","zh":"课程进展顺利……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b847e152f75e323a4249b414dea91db7f29bd1594c920550431d20ad91b39c75","ja":"リズム感は悪くないし、あたしのギターに負けずに、\nちゃんと声も出せてたな。","zh":"节奏感不差，也没输给我的吉他，\n声音也好好唱出来了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"30898710661734ec0e29f02c6959045df83cb5afaf8019d4890f4ee8e1424672","ja":"ダンスも上手だったね！　体力もあるし、\nこれなら合格も夢じゃないと思うよ♪","zh":"跳舞也跳得很好！体力也不错，\n这样合格也不是梦，我觉得♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"959400b14513af4e37ad131dc7b39d294a2bfc73fa9ec552bb2b2413d63fa819","ja":"「あ、ありがとうございます……」","zh":"「啊，谢谢你们……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"430675c120e6a9a3efa9fd750ce57b2a8dd002d16ade02f36a005896b93a9096","ja":"なんだか元気がないわね……悩みがあるなら教えて？\n私たちは全力で、あなたをサポートするから。","zh":"你好像有点没精神……有什么烦恼就告诉我吧？\n我们会全力支持你的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"53e3b376c26f5689cde0ad49ce690ec48ee323dcb06849f5f14e6a80e69a552d","ja":"「あの、それは……私には、\n皆さんみたいな強みがなくて。個性って言うか……」","zh":"“那个，因为……我没有像大家那样的长处。\n或者说，个性什么的……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"922195e32dc1cc5c0ae2d7405b537329137681dfb6bca30f1b70630c6c07f869","ja":"「私と言えばこれ、って胸を張れるものがある\nアイドルになりたいんです！」","zh":"「我想成为一个有自己的鲜明特色，\n能自豪地说“这就是我”的偶像！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"0ab0b9f235551c2f19106e0cdefd2e4e1b36482494939f646a9edcf5571c9b63","ja":"あれっ、そんなことないと思うけど……。\nね、歌織さん。","zh":"咦，我觉得不是那样……。\n嘿，歌织。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c0ff2e139459b20c6ad5a9122d4205cde69171d2973baee8438acbdd7050e3f1","ja":"ええ。ねえ、サツキちゃん、\nサツキちゃんの声は、とっても素敵な個性よ！","zh":"是啊。萨月，你的声音，\n就是非常棒的个性呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"6b35d7275f5a9bc84722cf903f4cc4a81d39c871dc538035b7f7cdd03af2db88","ja":"ああ、あたしも、最初に挨拶した時から\nそう思ってたぜ。いい声してる、ってな！","zh":"啊，我也是，从第一次打招呼时起\n就觉得你的声音很好听了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d046a68fb983db88af6c1bea13731adf3fcfcbd0048414c0e1ab365edd51d49a","ja":"「そ、そうなんですか！？　私の声が、個性……」","zh":"「真、真的吗！？我的声音，是我的个性……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"2e45b4103b234f56f35ac0485e287e8eca8c863a25afd764f9667f5f37c43610","ja":"ふふ、少しは自信が持てたかしら？　それじゃあ次は、\n歌う曲と、アピールの方向性を考えましょうか。","zh":"呵呵，多少有点自信了吧？那么接下来，\n来考虑要唱的歌曲，以及展现魅力的方向吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d3de77cf5847be13b7e18bb93964f536d53af2553f2118cc12e683898505e91e","ja":"あなたの個性、長所、目指すアイドルの形……。\nすべてを詰め込んだ、最高の一曲にしましょう！","zh":"你的个性、优点、所追求的偶像模样……。\n让我们把一切都融入其中，创作出最棒的一首歌吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
